        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ginés González García, Néstor Kirchner, Eduardo Duhalde\n- Roles: medical doctor, Minister of Health and Environment of Argentina, President of Argentina, Governor of Santa Cruz\n\nFacts:\n- Néstor Kirchner was born on 25 February 1950 and died on 27 October 2010.\n- Ginés González García was born in 1945 and is a medical doctor.\n- Néstor Kirchner was Governor of Santa Cruz from 1991 to 2003.\n- Néstor Kirchner served as President of Argentina from 2003 to 2007.\n- Ginés González García was the Minister of Health and Environment of Argentina during the administrations of Presidents Eduardo Duhalde and Néstor Kirchner.",
